In-Reply-To: <5vcVEa4DjvA.5_1vERGdAQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
References: <5vcVEa4DjvA.PDqv6nucAQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com> <5vcVEa4DjvA.5_1vERGdAQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
